      "content": "coffee?? he's only 14 months old, are you sure that's safe? i've never heard of giving a baby caffeine. i'm just so confused because he looks like he's struggling to breathe and you're saying it's an allergic reaction? i don't see any rash or anything, just the blue color and the gasping. how can i be sure it's not something more serious like his heart stopping or something? isn't that a reason to call 911 immediately?",
